%%{init: {
  "sequence": {
    "mirrorActors": false
  }
}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant C as SubmitAttemptController
    participant S as PracticeService
    participant B as DomainEventBus
    participant PH as StudentProgressHandler
    participant EP as ErrorLogProjector

    Note over S: Scored attempt saved -- dispatch domain event
    S->>B: publish("AttemptSubmitted", event)
    activate B
    B->>PH: handle(event)
    Note over PH: instanceof Student guard & update progress
    PH-->>B: Promise resolved
    B->>EP: handle(event)
    Note over EP: Deduplicate & project into ErrorLogEntry
    EP-->>B: Promise resolved
    deactivate B
    S-->>C: savedAttempt
    C-->>Student: 200 OK (Attempt)
